{"seq":1,"slug":"influence-in-china","title":"在中国的影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy/influence-in-china","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-pillar-of-chinese-thought","title":"中国思想的支柱","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy/influence-in-china/a-pillar-of-chinese-thought","wordCount":1753,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"daoism-and-religion","title":"道家与道教","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/influence-and-legacy/influence-in-china/daoism-and-religion","wordCount":1815,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"在中国的影响\">在中国的影响</h1><p>本章呈现老子在中国的深远影响。老子的道家思想，与儒家并立，是中国思想的一大支柱，深刻地塑造了中国人的精神；其影响更延伸到道教这一中国本土宗教。两篇文档，分别呈现中国思想的支柱，以及道家与道教。</p>\n"}